<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, Sept 20 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	 08/31/96   07/31/96---Rev from    08/31/95</p>
<p> Gallons     123,626    144,250    144,151     124,665</p>
<p> Lbs	 1,223,400  1,427,500  1,426,520   1,233,683</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
</text>
